OL,3,ACrypto firm Binance finds multiple
OL,4,A'points of breach' in $6.3bn hack
OL,5,Athought to be largest ever
OL,6,
OL,7,FBinance, the world's biggest crypto
OL,8,Fexchange, has been hit by what's
OL,9,Fthought to be the biggest hack in
OL,10,Fhistory at $6.3bn (#4.7bn) - here's how
OL,11,Fit compares to other attacks
OL,13,FThe company's co-CEO Richard Teng says
OL,14,Finitial investigations point to a
OL,15,F"compromised DevOps engineer's laptop"
OL,16,Fgiving hackers access, with a follow-up
OL,17,Fstatement from Binance saying it's
OL,18,F"uncovered additional points of breach"
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,107,105,200,300,0,100
